.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt HINSTALL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm hinstall
.Nd print a Proxmox install plan for a Hetzner server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm hinstall
.Fl -offline
.Fl -sums Ar file
.Fl -inventory Ar file
.Fl -spec Ar file
.Nm hinstall
.Fl -server Ar number
.Fl -reference Ar number
.Op Fl -vswitch-file Ar file
.Op Fl -yes-vswitch
.Nm hinstall
.Op Fl -hosts Ar file
.Op Fl -interfaces Ar file
.Op Fl -nic Ar name
.Op Fl -public-v6 Ar address
.Op Fl -lan Ar address
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the pieces of a Proxmox install and does not start the installer.
The only Robot write is
.Fl -yes-vswitch ,
and only for vSwitches that the reference server has and the target lacks.
.Fl -offline
refuses that flag.
.Pp
.Fl -yes-download
and
.Fl -yes-kvm
do not download an ISO and do not start kvm.
Either flag makes
.Nm
exit with an error.
The message says that step runs on the rescue host after a
yes on the printed line.
.Pp
Without
.Fl -offline ,
.Fl -server
reads
.Pa ~/.hcli.conf
and prints the host address, the
.Ql ::2
address inside
.Va server_ipv6_net .
.Fl -reference
also prints that server's
.Ql ::2
address when Robot has one.
.Pp
ISO lines come from
.Fl -sums
or, unless
.Fl -offline
is set, from
.Lk https://enterprise.proxmox.com/iso/SHA256SUMS .
The newest non-ARM Proxmox VE image is marked recommended.
A live sums file also triggers an AAAA lookup of
.Pa enterprise.proxmox.com .
If that lookup shows no address,
.Nm
prints that the ISO should not be downloaded yet.
.Pp
With
.Fl -reference
and
.Fl -server ,
membership is loaded from
.Fl -vswitch-file
or from Robot.
A vSwitch whose member list is missing is fetched by id.
Unknown membership is an error.
The delta is printed.
Without
.Fl -yes-vswitch
the last line of that section is
.Dq not posting vSwitch membership .
.Pp
.Fl -hosts
prints the next free LAN address from that hosts file and does not ping it.
The rendered interface draft needs
.Fl -interfaces ,
.Fl -nic ,
a public v6 address, and a LAN address.
The draft is printed.
The host interfaces file is not written.
.Pp
.Fl -inventory
and
.Fl -spec
together print the install checklist, the
.Xr qemu 1
argument list for the NVMe install disks, and the later
.Ql zpool
command when the plan has a special vdev.
Nothing in that section is executed.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "Fl -vswitch-file Ar file"
.It Fl -offline
Do not call Robot, do not fetch the sums file, and do not post.
.It Fl -server Ar number
Robot server number of the machine being installed.
.It Fl -reference Ar number
Robot server number whose vSwitch membership is the template.
.It Fl -inventory Ar file
JSON disk inventory.
.It Fl -spec Ar file
JSON layout spec.
.It Fl -interfaces Ar file
Host interfaces file to render from.
The output is a draft.
.It Fl -nic Ar name
Physical interface name used in that draft.
.It Fl -public-v6 Ar address
Public host address used in that draft.
Overrides the address read from Robot.
.It Fl -lan Ar address
LAN address used in that draft.
Overrides the candidate from
.Fl -hosts .
.It Fl -sums Ar file
Proxmox
.Pa SHA256SUMS
text, or an HTML index.
.It Fl -vswitch-file Ar file
JSON vSwitch list to use instead of a live Robot read.
.It Fl -hosts Ar file
Hosts file scanned for a free LAN address.
.It Fl -yes-vswitch
Attach the target to each missing vSwitch.
.Ql VSWITCH_IN_PROCESS
is retried three times, five seconds apart.
A later read must show the target on each posted vSwitch.
.It Fl -yes-download
Refused.
Does not download.
.It Fl -yes-kvm
Refused.
Does not start the virtual machine.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa ~/.hcli.conf
Robot user and password, read when
.Fl -server
is set and
.Fl -offline
is not.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std hinstall
A refused write, a bad argument, or a failed Robot read exits non-zero.
A plan that only prints exits 0, including the line that
says vSwitch membership was not posted.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Offline plan from fixtures:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
hinstall --offline \\
    --sums regress/fixtures/sha256sums \\
    --inventory regress/fixtures/pxj-inventory.json \\
    --spec regress/fixtures/pxj-spec.json
.Ed
.Pp
Show the vSwitch delta and do not post:
.Pp
.Dl hinstall --server 1 --reference 2
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr hcli 1 ,
.Xr qemu 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Todd T. Fries Aq Mt todd@fries.net
